    alt:
      'Conceptual strategy map of operating repeatability against emotional and experiential value. Event and wedding venues and large attraction farms sit high on emotion but low to moderate on disciplined operation. A traditional cider mill sits high on emotion with moderate operations. A conventional coffee shop and a Chick-fil-A-style quick-service restaurant sit high to very high on operations with moderate emotion. A roadside farm stand sits lower on both. Leaf and Lantern targets the upper right: very high on both axes.',
