      'Conceptual strategy map of repeat visit frequency against destination appeal. A grocery store is visited frequently but has low destination appeal; a coffee shop is frequent with moderate appeal. A wedding venue is extremely infrequent with high appeal, and a large pumpkin attraction and a traditional cider mill draw roughly one annual or a few autumn visits at high appeal. A garden center sits in the middle on both. Leaf and Lantern targets high destination appeal with materially higher repeat frequency: the upper right.',
