      'Conceptual strategy map of operating complexity against dependence on peak attendance. An amusement or festival farm is high on both. A wedding or event venue is high complexity with moderate dependence on individual high-value events. A traditional seasonal cider mill is moderate complexity with high autumn-volume dependence. A coffee shop is low to moderate complexity with low peak dependence, and a farm stand is low complexity with moderate seasonality. Leaf and Lantern targets low-to-moderate complexity and moderate peak dependence.',
    points: [
      { label: 'Wedding / event venue', x: 85, y: 52, pos: 'top' },
